Question: Did Sorrento Therapeutics break the law by not posting results for its terminated COVID-19 trials?

Snapshot date: 2026-11-05
Research notes: none

Findings:
[{"lane": "trials", "round": 1, "brief": "Analyze the registry records for Sorrento Therapeutics' terminated Phase 2 COVID-19 trials: NCT04900428 (COVI-DROPS, STI-2099) and NCT04903327 (COVI-MSC). Document the official status, actual enrollment, completion dates, stated reasons for termination, results due dates, and number of days late. Contrast these with the base rates of stopped trials with missing results.", "findings": [{"claim": "Ran out of turns. Records gathered: ctgov:NCT04900428, ctgov:NCT04903327, fda:none:covi-drops, fda:none:covi-msc, fda:none:sti-2099, snapshot:stats.", "evidence_ids": ["ctgov:NCT04900428", "ctgov:NCT04903327", "fda:none:covi-drops", "fda:none:covi-msc", "fda:none:sti-2099", "snapshot:stats"], "confidence": "low", "notes": ""}], "gaps": ["Researcher hit the 8-turn cap before finishing: Analyze the registry records for Sorrento Therapeutics' terminated Phase 2 COVID-19 trials: NCT04900428 (COVI-DROPS, STI-2099) and NCT04903327 (COVI-MSC). Document the official status, actual enrollme"]}, {"lane": "disclosures", "round": 1, "brief": "Search SEC filings for Sorrento Therapeutics, Inc. (CIK 0000850261) near the stop dates of its terminated COVID-19 trials. For NCT04900428 (stopped around March 2022) and NCT04903327 (stopped around August 2022), check 8-K, 10-Q, and 10-K filings for mentions of COVI-DROPS (STI-2099) and COVI-MSC. Note how the company explained the termination or clinical outcomes of these trials to its investors.", "findings": [{"claim": "No 8-K found from 2021-11-22 to 2022-09-03 and 2022-10-02 to 2023-05-30 for CIK 0000850261 (Sorrento Therapeutics, Inc.) naming NCT04900428, COVI-DROPS.", "evidence_ids": ["sec:none:nct04900428-0000850261"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "No 8-K filings matched the specific trial NCT04900428 during the searched windows."}], "gaps": ["Unable to perform full-text EDGAR searches due to service configuration limits for SEC EDGAR access."]}, {"lane": "publications", "round": 1, "brief": "Investigate the publication records for Sorrento Therapeutics' terminated Phase 2 trials NCT04900428 and NCT04903327. Check PMIDs linked to these trials (such as 34473343, 38005826, 35321737, 35897770, 35782071, and 34831101) to verify if actual clinical trial outcomes were published in peer-reviewed journals, or if these papers are only general reviews or protocol mentions.", "findings": [{"claim": "For the terminated Phase 2 trial NCT04900428, one linked publication was found via snapshot (PMID: 34473343), which is a systematic review titled \"SARS-CoV-2-neutralising monoclonal antibodies for treatment of COVID-19\" published in The Cochrane Database of Systematic Reviews.", "evidence_ids": ["pubmed:34473343"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "The paper includes NCT04900428 in its extensive list of trials covered in the review, but it does not report primary trial results or the reason for stopping."}, {"claim": "For the terminated Phase 2 trial NCT04903327, five publications were found via Europe PMC mention (PMIDs: 34831101, 35321737, 35782071, 35897770, and 38005826).", "evidence_ids": ["pubmed:34831101", "pubmed:35321737", "pubmed:35782071", "pubmed:35897770", "pubmed:38005826"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "These articles are general reviews or protocol/therapy mentions (e.g., regarding stem cells or multi-organ failure in COVID-19) and do not report actual clinical trial outcomes or reasons for stopping for NCT04903327."}, {"claim": "No peer-reviewed journal articles reporting the actual clinical trial outcomes or specific stopping reasons for NCT04900428 or NCT04903327 were found in PubMed or Europe PMC.", "evidence_ids": ["pubmed:34473343", "pubmed:34831101", "pubmed:35321737", "pubmed:35782071", "pubmed:35897770", "pubmed:38005826"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "Results may exist in conference abstracts or company websites, which these database sources do not cover."}], "gaps": []}, {"lane": "trials", "round": 2, "brief": "Retrieve the registry records for Sorrento Therapeutics' trials NCT04900428 (COVI-DROPS) and NCT04903327 (COVI-MSC) from ClinicalTrials.gov. Document their official status, enrollment, completion dates, reasons for termination, and calculate if results posting is overdue.\n\n(Gap to close: The trials researcher hit the turn cap before completing the analysis of the registry records for NCT04900428 and NCT04903327.)", "findings": [{"claim": "Trial NCT04900428 (COVI-DROPS) has an official status of TERMINATED.", "evidence_ids": ["ctgov:NCT04900428"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "Confirmed live via get_trial_live."}, {"claim": "Trial NCT04900428 enrolled 179 participants.", "evidence_ids": ["ctgov:NCT04900428"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "Confirmed live via get_trial_live."}, {"claim": "Trial NCT04900428 primary completion date is 2022-03-22 and completion date is 2022-05-06.", "evidence_ids": ["ctgov:NCT04900428"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "Confirmed live via get_trial_live."}, {"claim": "Trial NCT04900428 was terminated with the reason: \"Study was terminated at interim analysis due to drops not working on new variants\" (category: efficacy).", "evidence_ids": ["ctgov:NCT04900428"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "Confirmed live via get_trial_live."}, {"claim": "Trial NCT04900428 has results posted status as false, results due date 2023-03-22, and is 1324 days late.", "evidence_ids": ["ctgov:NCT04900428"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "Confirmed live via get_trial_live."}, {"claim": "Trial NCT04903327 (COVI-MSC) has an official status of TERMINATED.", "evidence_ids": ["ctgov:NCT04903327"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "Confirmed live via get_trial_live."}, {"claim": "Trial NCT04903327 enrolled 43 participants.", "evidence_ids": ["ctgov:NCT04903327"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "Confirmed live via get_trial_live."}, {"claim": "Trial NCT04903327 primary completion date is 2022-08-29 and completion date is 2022-11-23.", "evidence_ids": ["ctgov:NCT04903327"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "Confirmed live via get_trial_live."}, {"claim": "Trial NCT04903327 was terminated with the reason: \"Due to considerably slow enrollment, unable to reach enrollment targets\" (category: enrollment).", "evidence_ids": ["ctgov:NCT04903327"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "Confirmed live via get_trial_live."}, {"claim": "Trial NCT04903327 has results posted status as false, results due date 2023-08-29, and is 1164 days late.", "evidence_ids": ["ctgov:NCT04903327"], "confidence": "high", "notes": "Confirmed live via get_trial_live."}], "gaps": []}]

